Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.21,0:00:08.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is anyone else here getting nervous?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.89,0:00:09.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try to stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.95,0:00:14.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Times like these require us to keep\Nour heads on straight and be prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.33,0:00:20.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Putting this stuff on with only one hand\Nis a lot harder than I thought it'd be.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.27,0:00:23.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, before we leave, has\Nanyone here ever scuba-dyed before?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.75,0:00:25.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not me. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.29,0:00:26.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I haven't.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.33,0:00:28.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to teach us how to\Nuse this equipment right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.03,0:00:31.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That thing is going to\Nattack us any second!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.49,0:00:33.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try and calm yourself, Avdol.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.99,0:00:36.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must never panic, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.63,0:00:39.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is the most important\Nrule when scuba diving.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.13,0:00:44.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you're traveling underwater, for\Nevery 10 meters you go below the surface,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.15,0:00:47.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the corresponding pressure\Nincreases along with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.19,0:00:49.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The surface pressure\Nstarts at 1 atmosphere,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.43,0:00:51.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and since we're 40\Nmeters below the surface,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.85,0:00:54.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll endure 5 atmospheres of pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.15,0:00:55.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we surface too quickly,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.99,0:00:59.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the pressure will cause our\Nlungs and blood vessels to burst.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.13,0:01:01.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to rise slowly\Nso our bodies can adjust.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.11,0:01:06.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since we're nearing the Egyptian coast,\Nit's best to ascend along the sea floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.59,0:01:08.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm letting the water in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.39,0:01:17.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now pay very close attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.35,0:01:19.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What you're looking at is a regulator.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.13,0:01:22.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The valve inside only allows air\Nin from the tank when you inhale.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.97,0:01:26.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The air you breathe out exits\Nthrough the piece on the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.25,0:01:29.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a second, what about spit?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.29,0:01:32.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happens if I need to drool or\Nhave to huck a loogie or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.53,0:01:35.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stuff like that just comes\Nout of the opening here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.39,0:01:38.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, this should go without\Nsaying, but we can't talk underwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.05,0:01:40.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instead, we'll use hand signals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.87,0:01:43.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's keep things simple and only use two.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.33,0:01:46.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When things are going smoothly,\Nwe'll use this to say okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.03,0:01:48.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But when they aren't, use this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.65,0:01:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.56,0:01:53.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, couldn't we just use our\Nstands to communicate underwater?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.45,0:01:54.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.05,0:01:56.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't think about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.33,0:01:57.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.24,0:02:00.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I was just about to say that\NI Know a really good hand signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.65,0:02:06.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He says, "Your underwear\Nis showing." Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.03,0:02:13.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we could Be attacked
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.15,0:02:14.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and killed at any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.43,0:02:16.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop fooling around and let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.47,0:02:21.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This room is is about to be\Nfilled to the brim with water.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.63,0:02:25.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put on your masks and regulators\Nwhile you still have time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.73,0:02:48.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.63,0:02:54.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ng ng ng and
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.39,0:03:01.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.83,0:03:12.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,next one,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.74,0:03:14.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the star dance?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.23,0:03:26.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.63,0:03:27.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.03,0:03:35.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.35,0:03:44.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much for watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.91,0:03:47.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.23,0:03:54.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be
