Dialogue: 2,0:04:25.34,0:04:29.31,Title 3,Title,0,0,0,,{\fad(652,615)\pos(197,807)\fscx86}Episode 24: The High Priestess, Part 2
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.69,0:04:27.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, when did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.89,0:04:31.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.93,0:04:34.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The stand had already\Nintegrated with the regulator.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.01,0:04:36.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.49,0:04:39.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gonna rip him apart from the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.29,0:04:42.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've gotta drain the\Nroom while we still can.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.75,0:04:43.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.73,0:04:46.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must have been lying in\Nwait for just this moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.03,0:04:50.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.79,0:04:53.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's already burrowing down his throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.29,0:04:56.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't just stand here\Nwatching him like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.09,0:04:57.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.31,0:04:59.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pyrofad Green!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.83,0:05:00.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Urban Purple!
