Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.95,0:05:05.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.17,0:05:09.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was able to grab it before\Nit could damage his organs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.17,0:05:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.08,0:05:12.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's pull it out before it transforms.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.71,0:05:17.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Success!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.77,0:05:18.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.68,0:05:19.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep it just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.51,0:05:21.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.42,0:05:23.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's transforming into something else!
