Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.93,0:05:32.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Emerald Splash!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.71,0:05:33.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silver Tyrion!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.39,0:05:47.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get movie it's already\Nreloading it doesn't quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.27,0:05:48.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.27,0:05:57.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move it old man yeah i'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.19,0:06:08.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was too close for comfort.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.59,0:06:10.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too soon for us to relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.73,0:06:15.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Especially since that bastard knows\Nexactly how to hit us where it hurts most.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.25,0:06:16.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff, are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.39,0:06:18.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.21,0:06:21.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys saved my life back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.27,0:06:22.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Merci beaucoup.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.53,0:06:41.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, just look at how\Nbeautiful it is down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.83,0:06:45.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This would have been a spectacular\Nplace to visit on vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.15,0:06:47.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't time to plan your next getaway.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.35,0:06:50.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to surface before\Nwe run out of oxygen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.55,0:06:51.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think we're safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.53,0:06:52.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.93,0:06:56.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The high priestess can\Ntransform into metals and glass,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.11,0:06:58.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it can't take the\Nform of bubbles or fish?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.29,0:07:00.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I doubt it'll come after us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.21,0:07:01.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just keep your eyes peeled.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.63,0:07:06.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it pursues us, it'll probably transform\Ninto a screw on our gear to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.99,0:07:09.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful of moving\Npebbles and stones, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.29,0:07:15.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.49,0:07:17.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's a sea tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.25,0:07:21.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're at seven meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.53,0:07:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've finally reached the Egyptian shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.83,0:07:27.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can swim along these\Nrocks to get to the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.93,0:07:47.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.73,0:07:52.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's definitely the stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.13,0:07:56.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It merged with the sea\Nfloor, and it's Norgantuan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.13,0:08:00.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, there's no way\Nwe can fight this pool.
