Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.03,0:08:06.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.27,0:08:10.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is it so gigantic?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.53,0:08:21.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.91,0:08:23.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was so small earlier!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.01,0:08:25.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this dance power?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.39,0:08:27.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, I'm too confused!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.43,0:08:31.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You boys are so slow on the uptake!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.63,0:08:35.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't it ever cross your mind\Nthat if the rocks are mineral,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.55,0:08:38.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it would mean the seabed\Nis mostly mineral as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.81,0:08:39.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.03,0:08:42.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why the stand has\Nsuddenly gotten stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.85,0:08:46.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Its user must be nearby, and I'd\Nwager she's closer than we think.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.85,0:08:51.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guessed it, and to be more precise,\NI'm seven meters above you on the shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.41,0:08:56.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But since you're about to be ground\Nto bits by my high priestess,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.45,0:08:59.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'll never have the\Nchance to see my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.35,0:09:00.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So long!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.09,0:09:16.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so dark in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.69,0:09:18.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't tell what part\Nof the stand we're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.07,0:09:21.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems like we're still inside its mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.15,0:09:23.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But luckily, we weren't\Nsucked down its gullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.23,0:09:25.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoo-hoo! Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.51,0:09:28.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe it or not,\Nyou're actually my type.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.07,0:09:34.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is going to be as painful for\Nme as for you, but despite my feelings!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.45,0:09:37.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still have to make the\Nhigh priestess digest you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.71,0:09:42.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How sad if only our encounter\Nhad been under different?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.15,0:09:47.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Circumstances, but if I kill you lord\Ndeal will no doubt shower me with praise.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.17,0:09:49.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So don't hate me
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.99,0:09:54.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good grief do I have to\Nwould you just say it
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.71,0:09:57.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,come on hurry up and\Nget on with it say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.81,0:10:00.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.75,0:10:04.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a shame things turned out this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.21,0:10:07.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would have liked to have seen\Nyour face, if only this once.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.69,0:10:09.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You might have been my type, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.71,0:10:13.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if you were, well, I just\Nmight have fallen for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.37,0:10:17.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.57,0:10:18.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.81,0:10:20.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet she's a beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.35,0:10:22.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can tell from that\Ngorgeous voice of hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.63,0:10:24.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She comes across as an elegant woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.75,0:10:26.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My fortune teller's instinct senses it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.73,0:10:30.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if you ask me, she sounds\Njust like Audrey Hepburn.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.71,0:10:32.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, if I were only 30 years younger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.61,0:10:43.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastards didn't mean\Na single word of that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.33,0:10:44.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you all!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.25,0:10:48.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.83,0:10:49.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.73,0:10:51.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.13,0:10:53.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like a tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.61,0:10:55.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Stan's tongue, to be exact.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.47,0:10:57.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here it comes! Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.33,0:11:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.17,0:11:04.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clove!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.57,0:11:08.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Jotaro's going to land in...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.93,0:11:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.84,0:11:11.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He landed right on the bowlers!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.47,0:11:13.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, get out of there now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.45,0:11:15.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're about to be crushed!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.61,0:11:20.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to pick your\Nstrength against mine, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.79,0:11:23.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, what ridiculous power!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.27,0:11:25.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, give up, Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.57,0:11:27.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those teeth are as hard as diamonds!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.03,0:11:30.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll never be able to break them!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.45,0:11:33.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time for you to meet your end!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.49,0:11:35.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to save Jokoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.51,0:11:38.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.51,0:11:39.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That damn tongue again!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.53,0:11:45.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Magicians, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.57,0:11:56.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're out of time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.21,0:11:58.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to free him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.63,0:12:05.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro!
