Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.75,0:12:15.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.95,0:12:17.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.86,0:12:19.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those giant teeth pulverized him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.87,0:12:29.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jo... Jotaro...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.41,0:12:32.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We didn't make it in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.65,0:12:38.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.05,0:12:40.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I can hear something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.87,0:12:44.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's definitely coming from\Nfar away. Listen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.21,0:12:45.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's getting closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.85,0:12:48.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, that voice belongs to...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.21,0:12:52.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The teeth!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.35,0:12:54.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's coming from inside the teeth!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.95,0:12:55.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.86,0:12:58.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, get down and\Nbrace yourselves! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.81,0:13:09.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those teeth were hot as diamonds,\Nbut he managed to punch his way out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.59,0:13:10.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.65,0:13:11.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And would you look at that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.85,0:13:14.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's breaking the other\Nteeth while he's at it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.33,0:13:15.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That show-off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.79,0:13:18.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His stance amidst power\Nnever ceases to amaze me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.39,0:13:20.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.53,0:13:22.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm getting us out of this hellhole.
