Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.73,0:13:34.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.15,0:13:39.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you were right about those teeth being\Nsturdy, but they weren't sturdy enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.49,0:13:40.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.47,0:13:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess your so-called diamonds\Nwere a little low on calcium.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.65,0:14:03.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You couldn't pay me to do that again, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.47,0:14:08.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, there's a woman\Npassed out over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.13,0:14:11.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I assume it's Rose, the\Nuser of the High Priestess.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.39,0:14:12.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She doesn't seem dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.01,0:14:14.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should we just leave her?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.17,0:14:16.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I'll go see if she's hot or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.57,0:14:19.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From the looks of it, she's\Ngot a pretty nice body.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.07,0:14:21.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.07,0:14:25.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's it going over there, Polnareff?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.03,0:14:27.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing to see here, folks!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.61,0:14:28.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No comment whatsoever!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.17,0:14:31.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trust me, you don't want to see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.15,0:14:34.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pratival, there's no\Npoint in looking. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.91,0:14:44.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It hasn't been easy, but we\Nfinally made it to Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.83,0:14:45.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.74,0:14:47.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A trip that would have\Ntaken a mere 20 hours
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.83,0:14:50.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,by plane ended up taking\Na whopping 30 days.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.59,0:14:53.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been quite the adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.23,0:14:57.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've gone inside a brain and even\Ninside our dreams. Our dreams?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.39,0:14:58.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, Kakyoin?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.99,0:15:00.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you talking about dreams?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.71,0:15:01.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.62,0:15:03.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wake up already. Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.25,0:15:04.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys don't remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.03,0:15:05.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.99,0:15:09.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.31,0:15:17.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Five mysterious and otherworldly stands.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.91,0:15:21.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Powered by the mystical and\Nsymbolized by the tarot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.73,0:15:30.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joseph Joestar once described their\Njourney as around the world in 80 days.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:25.94,0:15:30.91,Insert Jap,,0,0,0,,Tojirare teta toki ni
Dialogue: 1,0:15:25.94,0:15:30.91,Insert Eng,,0,0,0,,Within the confines of time
