Dialogue: 1,0:16:13.26,0:16:18.97,Insert Jap,,0,0,0,,Break You Down Break You Down Break You Down michi wo hiraku
Dialogue: 1,0:16:13.26,0:16:18.97,Insert Eng,,0,0,0,,Break you down, break you down, break you down, carve out your own path
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.79,0:16:17.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With several of Dio's\Nassassins vanquished.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.33,0:16:19.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They have finally arrived in Egypt!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:18.97,0:16:24.52,Insert Jap,,0,0,0,,Tamashi no Vision Stand Proud!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:18.97,0:16:24.52,Insert Eng,,0,0,0,,May your spirit's vision Stand Proud!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.43,0:16:23.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only a few of the tarot\Ncards still remain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.69,0:16:25.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But little do Jojo and company know?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.99,0:16:27.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,New threats lie ahead in Egypt!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.01,0:16:30.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready to take our heroes on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.97,0:16:42.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's one!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.33,0:16:43.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.89,0:16:44.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.80,0:16:45.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nine!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.72,0:16:48.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are nine in all, both genders.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.87,0:17:00.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.99,0:17:03.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.21,0:17:22.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have the meddlesome flies\Nswarming around been swatted?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.41,0:17:24.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That speed wagon foundation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.19,0:17:29.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For pity's sake, I can't let\Nmy guard down for a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.19,0:17:43.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must say, I've gotten\Nquite used to this body.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.97,0:17:46.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Jonathan, can you feel it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.11,0:17:49.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your descendants are inching ever closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.03,0:17:57.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can be so cruel and unforgiving,\Nthis wretched little world of ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.03,0:18:05.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's what's been going on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.61,0:18:09.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you just tell me Jotaro\Nwas helping you with your work?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.59,0:18:10.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's fantastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.93,0:18:15.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The boy still has a long\Nway to go compared to me so
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.87,0:18:18.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this work is important enough\Nfor you to ask for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.73,0:18:20.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.53,0:18:24.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my most important mission yet, and\Nit's imperative that we don't mess up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.85,0:18:29.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But as long as we work together, we should\Nget it done without too much trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.71,0:18:34.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say Joseph could I speak to Jotaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.17,0:18:39.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure, but what do you want to talk\Nto him about nothing much is it wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.41,0:18:45.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That I want to hear my darling\Ngrandson's voice well no Jotaro it's for
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.99,0:18:50.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you hey it's me grandpa Told me
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.71,0:18:53.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,everything Jotaro work hard and take care
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.05,0:18:58.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of your grandfather for me will do I\Nknow in my Heart if you work together
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.89,0:19:02.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you Joestar men can overcome just\Nabout any hardship that comes your
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.69,0:19:04.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.60,0:19:06.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I truly believe that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.63,0:19:09.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grandma Susie, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.97,0:19:11.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.41,0:19:13.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sound so serious all of a sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.77,0:19:15.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.97,0:19:17.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, I'm hanging up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.59,0:19:19.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to good news. Ciao!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.39,0:19:23.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Madam. Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.05,0:19:25.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard for me to believe it,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.79,0:19:28.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but at this point it's\Nalready been 30 years
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.45,0:19:30.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that I've worked for the Joestar family.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.67,0:19:35.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I can honestly say that we've never\Nfaced something of this magnitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.25,0:19:36.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.16,0:19:37.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're overreacting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.63,0:19:40.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't he say it was just\Na little business trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.39,0:19:42.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose so.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.45,0:19:46.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so troublesome when men act\Nselfish and refuse to tell us anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.59,0:19:53.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I've grown accustomed to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.57,0:19:57.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Joestar family has been\Nlike this for an entire century.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.29,0:20:03.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure if she were here, she'd say\Nthe same thing and laugh it all off.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.97,0:20:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.88,0:20:15.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Jotaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.91,0:20:19.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nothing. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.61,0:20:22.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, it's time to head out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.05,0:20:24.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After a century,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.31,0:20:28.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's time for us Joestars to bring\Nan end to Dio's grip on our family.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.17,0:20:30.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we don't have to do it alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.95,0:20:34.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mr. Joestar!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.13,0:20:37.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got the car that you asked us to buy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.79,0:20:39.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry and hit the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.39,0:20:43.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should probably get to where\Nwe're going before it gets too dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.47,0:20:45.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, old man, okay, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.93,0:20:47.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess we're pretty lucky, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.25,0:20:49.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, hold your horses.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.77,0:20:50.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.97,0:20:56.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the land of Egypt,\Na nation that's 97 % desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.15,0:20:57.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.11,0:20:59.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thanks to the blessings of the Nile,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.91,0:21:04.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,beautiful fertile green spreads\Nacross the entirety of its riverbanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.23,0:21:08.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In addition to the culture\Nof the ancient Egyptians,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.37,0:21:12.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Egypt is also home to Persian, Greek,\NRoman, Muslim, and Arabian cultures?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.87,0:21:15.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and all have left their indelible marks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.97,0:21:19.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What bizarre adventures and\Nchallenges await Jotaro and the others
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.97,0:21:23.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in this eternal land as they\Ncontinue their perilous journey.
